	"data": "Atlas Code\n\nVR code editor for Meta Quest. Vim-style modal editing in spatial panels.\nRepo: <https://github.com/gearscrafter/atlas_code>\nLicense: Apache-2.0\nStars: New (March 2026)\nStatus: ~85% complete, tested on Quest Pro and Quest 3\n\nWhat It Provides\nVim-style modal editing (NORMAL/INSERT/VISUAL) in VR\nMulti-language syntax highlighting (C++, Java, Python, Dart)\nMulti-panel spatial architecture\nIntegrated terminal with command execution\nFile operations\nOpenXR integration\nWorld-locked and…",
